X: 1
T: I Dream of Jeannie
O: Hugo Montenegro, 1966
N: The season 2-5 theme "Jeannie"; season 1 used a waltz by Richard Wess.
N: From a hamienet.com MIDI (id 352766908564040): A part from channel 5
N: (muted trumpet), B part from the lower octave of channel 2 (brass).
N: Form as in the arrangement: A twice, B, A twice, then the Eb-E-F tag.
N: Chords read off the MIDI's bass line and comp stabs: the A riff is a
N: C pedal with Gm/Dm colors and the tail lands on F; the B part is in
N: Db major (bass Db-Ab-Gb).
N: CHECK: only one arrangement of this theme exists anywhere (id 13034 is
N: this MIDI re-uploaded), so the Db-major B part rests on one sequencer.
L: 1/8
Q: 1/4=215
M: 4/4
K: F
